---
// Full-width hairline with ruler ticks at the column lines.
---

<div class="ruler" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .ruler {
    height: 9px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--c-ink);
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to right,
      var(--c-rule) 0 1px,
      transparent 1px calc((100% + var(--grid-gutter)) / var(--grid-cols))
    );
  }
</style>
